---
title: UX journey - Android app screens (strategies-mobile, client role only)
---
flowchart TB
    START(["App launch"])
    RESTORE["Restoring<br>spinner while the stored refresh token is tried"]

    subgraph PUBM["Signed out"]
        LOGINM["LoginScreen<br>email + password<br>staff told to use the web portal"]
    end

    subgraph CLIM["Client, signed in: HomeScreen with bottom navigation"]
        direction TB
        TOP["Top bar<br>bell with unread count + avatar menu"]
        T0["My case tab (ProgressTab)<br>5-stage progress, Action needed card"]
        T1["Documents tab (DocumentsTab)<br>status, rejection note, approved count<br>no upload: 'use the web portal'"]
        T2["Messages tab (NotificationsTab)<br>notifications, tap marks read"]
    end

    START --> RESTORE
    RESTORE -->|token valid, role Client| T0
    RESTORE -->|no token or refresh failed| LOGINM
    LOGINM -->|200 and role Client| T0
    LOGINM -->|Admin or Consultant: token revoked, notice shown| LOGINM
    LOGINM -->|401 or 429| LOGINM
    T0 <-->|bottom nav| T1
    T1 <-->|bottom nav| T2
    T0 <-->|bottom nav| T2
    T0 -->|See what's needed| T1
    TOP -->|bell| T2
    TOP -->|menu: Sign out, refresh token revoked| LOGINM
    CLIM -->|session expired| LOGINM

    classDef state fill:#f5f5f5,stroke:#888
    class START,RESTORE state
